  @contract  selection must be exactly one grid column; multi-col selection is a no-op  @ 3026
  @invariant  a 1-col block stays contiguous when it lands on the destination col  @ 3027
  @contract  cursor follows to the destination column (single event and selection alike)  @ 3028
  @contract  refuse if dest col has any onset in source's row extent (note: note-on; else any event)  @ 3029
